{"artifact_id":"id:e20ef106ceac0eae5334b043dc9b2ba184a01bda6f8587e3ff3298c6443af9f6","artifact_type":"normalized_source","canonical_payload_sha256":"257e8a553ac693885f938e5410c46affc894014851faf361cee49a18bb8b5c87","created_at_utc":"2026-08-03T06:00:58Z","knowledge_snapshot_digest":null,"parent_artifact_ids":[],"payload":{"character_count":226,"encoding":"utf-8","line_start_offsets":[0,5,22,33,45,72,101,142,173],"normalized_text":"第35集\n35.1 人民医院－门口 夜 外\n人物：陈厚坤、周从文\n▲辰两人并肩走出医院。\n陈厚坤（看着周从文，由衷感叹）：小周，今天多亏了你。\n周从文（笑笑）：陈教授谬赞了，我只是三院的一个小小主治。\n陈厚坤（摇头、摆手离去）：我清楚自己的医术，这两次手术如果没有你，哪会那么顺利。\n▲目送陈厚坤离去的背影，周从文拿出手机，拨通了李庆华的电话。\n周从文：主任，医院的作业流程要重新梳理，特别是急诊通道和病床周转率。今天之后，咱们三院可能会迎来更多病患。","partitions":[{"episode_id":"episode-a10-ep35","scene_id":"scene-a10-ep35","source_end":226,"source_start":0}],"source_ref":{"digest":"91203e09f324a36d166739786e8ecda675991b8088553b8e5d8a9e4922366aac","locator":null,"source_id":"raw-source-91203e09f324a36d"}},"producer_stage":"I0:source-normalizer","schema_version":"3.0","source_provenance":[{"digest":"91203e09f324a36d166739786e8ecda675991b8088553b8e5d8a9e4922366aac","locator":null,"source_id":"raw-source-91203e09f324a36d"}]}